---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Work | Rafi Aqila Hidayat"
  description="Experience, education, certifications and skills of Rafi Aqila Hidayat, a data & AI consultant in Kuala Lumpur."
  active="work"
>
  <!-- ═══ EXPERIENCE ═══ -->
  <section class="section section--page-top" id="experience">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section__eyebrow reveal">Career</p>
      <h2 class="section__title reveal">Experience</h2>
      <div class="exp-list">

        <div class="exp-entry reveal">
          <div class="exp-date">
            May 2025 &ndash; Present
            <span class="exp-type">Full-time</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="exp-company">Synogize · Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia</p>
            <div class="exp-subroles">
              <div class="exp-subrole">
                <div class="exp-subrole__header">
                  <h3 class="exp-role">Consultant</h3>
                  <span class="exp-subrole__date">Jul 2026 &ndash; Present</span>
                </div>
                <ul class="exp-bullets">
                  <li>Build a governed Snowflake semantic view, and design the process to extract, approve, version and deploy metric definitions across AI and BI tools</li>
                  <li>Cut storage costs by 45% by redesigning the data pipeline, and compute costs by ~10% through more efficient queries</li>
                  <li>Take on greater ownership and delivery responsibility on data engineering projects, including mentoring an associate consultant</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
              <div class="exp-subrole">
                <div class="exp-subrole__header">
                  <h3 class="exp-role">Associate Data Consultant</h3>
                  <span class="exp-subrole__date">May 2025 &ndash; Jul 2026</span>
                </div>
                <ul class="exp-bullets">
                  <li>Built cloud-based data engineering pipelines for a client, delivering clean, well-modelled semantic layers that power both analytics and AI use cases</li>
                  <li>Won 1st place in the Synogize internal Snowflake AISQL Innovation Challenge, building an end-to-end AI site safety inspection app using Snowflake Cortex AI functions</li>
                  <li>Built Snowflake Intelligence, an NL2SQL chatbot enabling business users to query their own data through natural language conversation</li>
                </ul>
                <div class="exp-tech">
                  <span class="chip"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/snowflake/000000" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">Snowflake</span>
                  <span class="chip">Fivetran</span>
                  <span class="chip">SQL</span>
                  <span class="chip"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/python/000000" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">Python</span>
                  <span class="chip"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/qlik/000000" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">Qlik</span>
                  <span class="chip"><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@latest/icons/powerbi.svg" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">Power BI</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="exp-entry reveal">
          <div class="exp-date">
            Aug &ndash; Nov 2024
            <span class="exp-type">Internship</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="exp-role">Data Scientist Intern</h3>
            <p class="exp-company">eBdesk Malaysia · Petaling Jaya, Selangor</p>
            <ul class="exp-bullets">
              <li>Performed data cleaning, exploratory analysis, and trend identification on structured datasets</li>
              <li>Built data visualisations and analytical reports for both technical and non-technical stakeholders</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="exp-tech">
              <span class="chip"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/python/000000" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">Python</span>
              <span class="chip"><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@latest/icons/tableau.svg" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">Tableau</span>
              <span class="chip"><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@latest/icons/powerbi.svg" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">Power BI</span>
              <span class="chip"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/knime/000000" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">Knime</span>
              <span class="chip"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/qgis/000000" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">QGIS</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="exp-entry reveal">
          <div class="exp-date">
            Jun 2024 &ndash; Apr 2025
            <span class="exp-type">Volunteer</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="exp-role">Research Officer</h3>
            <p class="exp-company">Youth for Energy Southeast Asia (Y4E-SEA) · Remote</p>
            <ul class="exp-bullets">
              <li>Built data visualisations and interactive dashboards on ASEAN energy trends and youth demographics, translating raw figures into narratives that shaped the organisation's research direction and public reports</li>
              <li>Co-authored published reports: &ldquo;Decarbonising the Unabatable: Green Hydrogen for Indonesia&rsquo;s Industrialised Future&rdquo; and &ldquo;ASEAN Generational Gap: The Missing Link for A Just Future&rdquo;</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="exp-entry reveal">
          <div class="exp-date">
            Jul &ndash; Oct 2023
            <span class="exp-type">Internship</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="exp-role">Industrial Engineer Intern</h3>
            <p class="exp-company">Infineon Technologies · Kulim, Kedah, Malaysia</p>
            <ul class="exp-bullets">
              <li>Developed a cross-site productivity improvement platform across Malaysia, Austria, and Germany, contributing to &euro;40M+ in projected savings</li>
              <li>Conducted time studies in photolithography; identified that the longest activity accounts for 42% of total process time and prepared solutions to address it</li>
              <li>Explored optimisation of photolithography machine utilisation using linear programming as part of undergraduate thesis</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ EDUCATION ═══ -->
  <section class="section" id="education">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section__eyebrow reveal">Background</p>
      <h2 class="section__title reveal">Education</h2>
      <div class="edu-grid reveal-stagger">

        <div class="edu-card reveal">
          <p class="edu-card__label">2020 &ndash; 2024</p>
          <h3 class="edu-card__degree">Bachelor of Engineering</h3>
          <p class="edu-card__school">Mechanical-Industrial Engineering</p>
          <p class="edu-card__meta">Universiti Teknologi Malaysia (UTM) · Johor Bahru</p>
          <div class="edu-cgpa">
            <span class="edu-cgpa__value">3.63</span>
            <span class="edu-cgpa__label">/ 4.00 CGPA</span>
          </div>
          <p class="edu-card__label">Achievements</p>
          <ul class="edu-card__text">
            <li>Dean&rsquo;s List: Semesters 1, 5, 6, 7, and 8</li>
            <li>4.00 GPA in final semester</li>
            <li>Vice President, Indonesian Student Association 2022/2023</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="edu-card__label">Relevant coursework</p>
          <p class="edu-card__text">Operations Research, Applied Numerical Methods, Engineering Statistics, Engineering Mathematics, Engineering Management</p>
        </div>

        <div class="edu-card reveal">
          <p class="edu-card__label">2022</p>
          <h3 class="edu-card__degree">Summer School</h3>
          <p class="edu-card__school">Robot Interaction Design Experience (2 ECTS)</p>
          <p class="edu-card__meta">University of Twente · Enschede, Netherlands</p>
          <p class="edu-card__label" style="margin-top:var(--sp-3xl)">Coursework</p>
          <p class="edu-card__text">3D CAD Modelling, Arduino Uno, Problem Identification &amp; Ideation</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ CERTIFICATIONS ═══ -->
  <section class="section" id="certifications" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section__eyebrow reveal">Credentials</p>
      <h2 class="section__title reveal">Certifications</h2>
      <div class="certs-grid reveal-stagger">

        <a href="https://achieve.snowflake.com/98f4a0a4-ee69-4a00-9723-f85709c18087" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cert-card reveal">
          <div class="cert-card__issuer">
            <img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/snowflake/000000" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
            <span class="cert-card__issuer-name">Snowflake</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="cert-card__title">SnowPro Core Certification</h3>
          <p class="cert-card__detail">Aug 2025 · Expires Aug 2027</p>
          <p class="cert-card__detail">ID: 157695956</p>
        </a>

        <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/api/credentials/share/en-us/rafi-hidayat/F24F40EEC70FF2BF?sharingId" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cert-card reveal">
          <div class="cert-card__issuer">
            <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@latest/icons/microsoftazure.svg" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
            <span class="cert-card__issuer-name">Microsoft</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="cert-card__title">Azure Fundamentals</h3>
          <p class="cert-card__detail">Sep 2025</p>
          <p class="cert-card__detail">ID: F24F40EEC70FF2BF</p>
        </a>

        <a href="https://www.credly.com/badges/1c1c0faf-8860-4934-af9a-c00c4407cb6a/linked_in_profile" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cert-card reveal">
          <div class="cert-card__issuer">
            <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@latest/icons/tableau.svg" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
            <span class="cert-card__issuer-name">Tableau</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="cert-card__title">Desktop Specialist</h3>
          <p class="cert-card__detail">Tableau · Nov 2024</p>
        </a>

        <a href="https://www.coursera.org/account/accomplishments/professional-cert/X7LS4NGAEZF8?utm_source=link&utm_medium=certificate&utm_content=cert_image&utm_campaign=sharing_cta&utm_product=prof" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cert-card reveal">
          <div class="cert-card__issuer">
            <img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/google/000000" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
            <span class="cert-card__issuer-name">Google · Coursera</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="cert-card__title">Google Data Analytics</h3>
          <p class="cert-card__detail">Professional Certificate</p>
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══ SKILLS ═══ -->
  <section class="section section--dark" id="skills">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section__eyebrow reveal">Toolkit</p>
      <h2 class="section__title reveal">Skills</h2>
      <div class="skills-categories">

        <div class="reveal">
          <h3 class="skills-cat__title">Data Engineering</h3>
          <div class="skills-cat__chips">
            <span class="chip chip--dark"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/snowflake/ffffff" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">Snowflake</span>
            <span class="chip chip--dark"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/googlebigquery/ffffff" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">BigQuery</span>
            <span class="chip chip--dark">Fivetran</span>
            <span class="chip chip--dark">SQL</span>
            <span class="chip chip--dark">Medallion Architecture</span>
            <span class="chip chip--dark">Data Modelling</span>
            <span class="chip chip--dark">ETL / ELT Pipelines</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal">
          <h3 class="skills-cat__title">Visualisation & BI</h3>
          <div class="skills-cat__chips">
            <span class="chip chip--dark"><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@latest/icons/tableau.svg" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">Tableau</span>
            <span class="chip chip--dark"><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@latest/icons/powerbi.svg" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">Power BI</span>
            <span class="chip chip--dark"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/qlik/ffffff" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">Qlik</span>
            <span class="chip chip--dark"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/looker/ffffff" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">Looker Studio</span>
            <span class="chip chip--dark"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/knime/ffffff" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">Knime</span>
            <span class="chip chip--dark"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/qgis/ffffff" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">QGIS</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal">
          <h3 class="skills-cat__title">Cloud & Infrastructure</h3>
          <div class="skills-cat__chips">
            <span class="chip chip--dark"><img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/simple-icons@latest/icons/microsoftazure.svg" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">Azure</span>
            <span class="chip chip--dark"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/googlecloud/ffffff" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">Google Cloud</span>
            <span class="chip chip--dark"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/snowflake/ffffff" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">Snowflake</span>
            <span class="chip chip--dark"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/docker/ffffff" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">Docker</span>
            <span class="chip chip--dark"><img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/n8n/ffffff" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'">n8n</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal">
          <h3 class="skills-cat__title">Engineering & Analytics</h3>
          <div class="skills-cat__chips">
            <span class="chip chip--dark">Integer Linear Programming</span>
            <span class="chip chip--dark">Operations Research</span>
            <span class="chip chip--dark">Process Optimisation</span>
            <span class="chip chip--dark">Time Studies</span>
            <span class="chip chip--dark">Statistical Analysis</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
